rd, Net Banking.<b> </b></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 181px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 181px;\" colspan=\"9\" valign=\"top\" width=\"784\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>RSMSSB Computer Instructor Notification 2026 : </b><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Age Limit as on 01/01/2027</b></span></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Minimum Age : <b>18&nbsp;Years</b></li>\n<li>Maximum Age : <b>40 Years</b></li>\n<li>Age Relaxation Extra as per RSSB Computer Instructor Advt No : 07/2026 Post Recruitment Exam 2026 Recruitment Rules<b>. </b></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 695px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 547px;\" colspan=\"9\" valign=\"top\" width=\"784\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Rajasthan Computer Instructor Recruitment 2026 : </b><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Vacancy Details Total : 3951 Post</b></span></span></h2>\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border-color: #000000;\" border=\"1\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 17.7123%; text-align: center;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25.1387%; text-align: center;\"><strong>Total Post</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 57.1489%; text-align: center;\"><strong>RSSB Rajasthan Computer Instructor Eligibility</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 17.7123%; text-align: center;\">Senior Computer Instructor</td>\n<td style=\"width: 25.1387%; text-align: center;\"><strong>322</strong><p></p>\n<p>TSP Area : 34 Post</p>\n<p>Non TSP Area : 322 Post</p></td>\n<td style=\"width: 57.1489%;\">\n<ul>\n<li>Master Degree in Computer Science (CS)/ Information Technology (IT)/ Electronics &amp; Communications Engineering (ECE)/ Electrical Engineering (EE)/ Electrical &amp; Electronics Engineering (EEE)/ Electronics &amp; Telecommunication Engineering (ETE)/ Electronics &amp; Instrumentation Engineering (EIE) OR Any Equivalent or Higher Qualification.</li>\n<li>More Eligibility Details Read the Notification.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 17.7123%; text-align: center;\">Basic Computer Instructor</td>\n<td style=\"width: 25.1387%; text-align: center;\"><strong>3629</strong><p></p>\n<p>TSP Area : 693 Post</p>\n<p>Non TSP Area : 2936 Post</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p></td>\n<td style=\"width: 57.1489%;\">\n<ul>\n<li>Bachelor Degree in Any Stream with A Level / PGDCA 1 Year Exam Passed OR</li>\n<li>BE / B.Tech / Degree in Computer Science (CS) / Information Technology (IT) /Electronics &amp; Communications Engineering (ECE) / Electrical Engineering (EE) / Electrical &amp; Electronics Engineering (EEE) / Electronic Instrumentation &amp; Control (EIC) /Telecommunications &amp; Instrumentation (TIE) OR</li>\n<li>B.SC in Computer Science / IT OR BCA.</li>\n<li>More Eligibility Details Read the Notification.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 326px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 326px;\" colspan=\"9\" valign=\"top\" width=\"784\">\n\n<ul>\n<li>Rajasthan Staff Selection Board RSMSSB / RSSB Computer Instructor Recruitment 2026. Candidate Can Apply Between <strong>25/05/2026 </strong><b>to 23/06/2026</b></li>\n<li>Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the Recruitment Application Form in RSSB Apply Online for Contractual Computer Instructor Vacancy 2026.</li>\n<li>Kindly Check and Collect the All Document – Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</li>\n<li>Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Recruitment Form – Photo, Sign, ID Proof, Etc.</li>\n<li>Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</li>\n<li>Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</li>\n<li>For the latest updates on Sarkari Result, admit card, answer key, and result, always visit SarkariResult.com, the official website for Sarkari Result in India (Since 2012).</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 60px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 60px;\" colspan=\"9\" valign=\"top\" width=\"784\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span s